5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but let's all try to get along and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the bad guy first! I'm super ready for this adventure!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I wonder who the werewolf is? Maybe it's someone we'd never expect! I'm so excited to play!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep our emotions in check. Logic is the only way to win this. I'll be watching everyone's behavior closely.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I trust we can maintain a certain level of decorum while we unravel this little puzzle.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,It's nice to see everyone so enthusiastic. I hope we can maintain a peaceful atmosphere while we discuss.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're being too serious! It's a game! Let's make it fun while we hunt the wolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I agree with Rin! Let's have a party while we play! But I'll be the one to solve the mystery first!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Fun is irrelevant to the outcome. @Rin, your excitement is a distraction. I prefer a calculated approach.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While I admire Shion's rigor, a touch of levity often reveals more about a person's nature than a cold interrogation.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think both perspectives have value. Let's just be honest with each other as much as we can.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm always honest! I'm just a little girl! No one would think I'm a scary wolf, right?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe that's exactly why you're suspicious, Rin! Teehee! Just kidding! I'm just curious about everyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"The ""innocent"" act is a classic trope. I'll be analyzing the patterns of your speech to see who's lying.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The most elegant lies are often wrapped in the most obvious truths. I shall enjoy observing this.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to be kind to one another, even if we suspect someone. Harmony is important.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be the best detective ever! I'm gonna help the village win! Watch me!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm gonna help too! Or maybe I'll just cause a little bit of trouble! Just a tiny bit!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've seen enough for today. I'll spend the night reflecting on your initial reactions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A wise choice, Shion. I believe I have enough data to begin my own contemplations.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
