33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. I've learned something, but I want to be careful about how I share it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have a scary dream? I dreamed I found a giant paw print!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! I slept great! I feel like today is going to be super interesting! Who should we suspect first?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, you sounded like you have information. If you're the Seer, revealing your result now might be too risky.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A perceptive observation, Shion. However, a strategic reveal can sometimes steer the village away from a mistake.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion is right. If I reveal too much, the werewolf might target me tonight. But I can say Shion is human.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Rin,,Wow! Midori is the Seer! That's so cool! Now we just have to find the wolf! Maybe it's Benjamin?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,@Benjamin? Why him? He's so fancy! But maybe he's a fancy wolf in a suit! That would be funny!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, if you are the Seer, you've confirmed me. That's a logical start. Now, let's look at the others.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your accusations are quite whimsical. I assure you, my suit is purely for aesthetic purposes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Please, let's not jump to conclusions. We should listen to everyone's reasoning before we vote.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Rin,,But it's more fun to guess! I bet the wolf is someone who talks a lot to hide their secret!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds like Rin! Hehe! Just kidding! But really, Benjamin is acting very calm. Is that a wolf thing?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Calmness isn't evidence. However, the way Sakura is deflecting and playing ""cute"" is slightly irritating.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I find it amusing that my composure is viewed as suspicious. Perhaps the wolf is simply the most agitated among us?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,I don't want anyone to feel attacked. But we do have to make a choice. I trust Shion for now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll vote for Benjamin! He's too fancy! It's suspicious! Let's go, adventure time!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll go with Rin! Let's see if the fancy man is a wolf! It'll be a great surprise!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I cannot support a vote based on ""fanciness."" However, Sakura's behavior is the most erratic. I'll vote Sakura.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,It seems I am the victim of a fashion critique. I shall vote for Sakura as well; her chaos is illogical.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
